WEBVTT

00:00.830 --> 00:06.770
<i>We are nearing the end of the
Sixth National Youth Football Tournament.</i>

00:06.810 --> 00:10.110
<i>As neither team secured victory after 40 minutes of regulation time,</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:13.700
<i>the fierce game continued into both the first and second extra times.</i>

00:13.700 --> 00:16.820
<i>And now, it all comes down to these last 5 minutes!</i>

00:17.360 --> 00:20.990
<i>Both Nankatsu and Meiwa have given everything they've got,</i>

00:20.990 --> 00:22.870
<i>and yet, the score remains tied at 2-2.</i>

00:22.870 --> 00:25.560
<i>Will one of them emerge victorious in the end?</i>

00:25.560 --> 00:28.880
<i>Or will the game end in a tie with both teams declared champions?</i>

00:28.880 --> 00:33.630
<i>The final kick-off of the tournament will
come shortly with the referee's whistle!</i>

00:33.630 --> 00:37.390
<i>As promised, we've stopped them from scoring in the first half.</i>

00:37.390 --> 00:40.260
<i>Tsubasa, Misaki... I leave this in your hands!</i>

00:40.260 --> 00:42.080
Tsubasa! Misaki!

00:42.080 --> 00:44.730
It's all up to you in the second half... our Golden Duo!

00:44.730 --> 00:48.150
<i>Even if my leg breaks, I'll play until the very end.</i>

00:48.150 --> 00:50.150
<i>I absolutely must score a goal!</i>

00:50.150 --> 00:54.440
<i>If I don't, I'll be wasting everyone's efforts in the first half.</i>

00:54.940 --> 00:56.500
<i>Come at me, if you dare.</i>

00:56.500 --> 00:58.410
<i>I'd sooner die than give up another goal.</i>

00:58.410 --> 00:59.780
<i>We won't lose.</i>

00:59.780 --> 01:02.870
<i>Whatever plan you've come up with is irrelevant.</i>

01:02.870 --> 01:04.660
<i>All we have to do is keep attacking!</i>

01:06.340 --> 01:07.920
Let's go, Misaki!

01:07.920 --> 01:08.780
All right!

01:22.030 --> 01:27.640
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

01:22.030 --> 01:27.640
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

01:27.640 --> 01:32.690
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

01:27.640 --> 01:32.690
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

01:33.360 --> 01:38.490
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

01:33.360 --> 01:38.490
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

01:39.240 --> 01:46.830
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

01:39.240 --> 01:46.830
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

01:46.830 --> 01:52.600
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

01:46.830 --> 01:52.600
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

01:52.600 --> 02:01.100
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

01:52.600 --> 02:01.100
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:01.100 --> 02:06.890
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:01.100 --> 02:06.890
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:06.890 --> 02:12.820
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:06.890 --> 02:12.820
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:12.820 --> 02:14.360
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:14.360 --> 02:21.650
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:14.360 --> 02:21.650
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

02:21.650 --> 02:24.570
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

02:21.650 --> 02:24.570
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

02:24.570 --> 02:29.500
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

02:24.570 --> 02:29.500
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

02:40.300 --> 02:44.720
<b><b>EPISODE 27:
THE MOMENT OF GLORY</b></b>

02:43.430 --> 02:44.840
It's the last 5 minutes!

02:44.840 --> 02:46.260
Keep fighting Nankatsu!

02:46.260 --> 02:47.680
Meiwa, don't lose!

02:47.680 --> 02:49.480
You'll be the champions!

02:50.980 --> 02:54.250
Come! We'll keep attacking until the bitter end!

02:54.250 --> 02:56.080
We'll steal the ball and attack!

02:56.080 --> 02:59.020
We'll show you Meiwa's play until the very last moment!

02:59.020 --> 03:00.070
Yeah!

03:03.490 --> 03:05.500
<i>Tsubasa feints his way through!</i>

03:05.500 --> 03:09.000
<i>These lively moves are likely due to the rest he got in the first half!</i>

03:13.330 --> 03:15.210
<i>I'll absolutely turn this into a goal.</i>

03:16.710 --> 03:17.590
Misaki!

03:17.590 --> 03:20.840
<i>And now he sends a splendid pass after luring his opponents in!</i>

03:20.840 --> 03:22.760
I won't let you!

03:22.760 --> 03:25.970
<i>He dodges! Misaki's movement is lively as well!</i>

03:25.970 --> 03:28.390
<i>It's the revival of Nankatsu's Golden Duo!</i>

03:28.390 --> 03:29.810
All right, we can do this!

03:31.700 --> 03:33.720
<i>He loses his balance!</i>

03:33.720 --> 03:35.850
<i>Looks like his injury is serious, after all!</i>

03:36.730 --> 03:37.730
Misaki!

03:40.270 --> 03:42.490
<i>Hyuga takes advantage and steals the ball!</i>

03:42.490 --> 03:44.830
Okay guys, we'll go and score!

03:44.830 --> 03:45.530
Yeah!

03:45.530 --> 03:47.860
<i>With Hyuga charging forward up the middle,</i>

03:47.860 --> 03:49.910
<i>Meiwa goes for a quick attack!</i>

03:51.720 --> 03:53.540
Can Misaki not do it...?

03:53.540 --> 03:55.250
Taro...

03:55.250 --> 03:56.880
Guys! Don't go losing your nerve!

03:56.880 --> 03:58.640
Believe in Misaki!

03:58.640 --> 04:00.240
He'll surely deliver!

04:00.240 --> 04:02.240
We'll stop this attack!

04:02.240 --> 04:02.880
Okay!

04:06.280 --> 04:07.430
Like I'd let you through!

04:07.430 --> 04:09.010
Keep fighting, guys!

04:09.010 --> 04:11.920
<i>My leg is at its limit, too.</i>

04:11.920 --> 04:17.020
<i>But I need to make sure I stop Meiwa's attack, here!</i>

04:17.020 --> 04:19.520
<i>Come on, leg... please hold on just a little longer!</i>

04:19.520 --> 04:22.080
<i>Everyone's doing this all because of me...</i>

04:22.080 --> 04:23.050
<i>Damn it!</i>

04:23.050 --> 04:25.590
<i>Will this be the end of Taro Misaki...?!</i>

04:25.590 --> 04:27.780
<i>Just let me give one final push.</i>

04:27.780 --> 04:29.450
<i>Dad!</i>

04:29.450 --> 04:31.290
<i>Mom!</i>

04:32.740 --> 04:33.660
Hyuga!

04:34.580 --> 04:35.570
Oh no!

04:35.570 --> 04:38.210
<i>Hyuga is unmarked, and the ball reaches him!</i>

04:38.210 --> 04:40.710
<i>Hyuga shoots!</i>

04:40.710 --> 04:42.380
<i>Will it be a goal?!</i>

04:43.760 --> 04:45.650
<i>No, it's blocked!</i>

04:45.650 --> 04:48.510
<i>Tsubasa blocks Hyuga's shot!</i>

04:48.510 --> 04:49.390
What?!

04:49.390 --> 04:50.220
Tsubasa!

04:51.140 --> 04:53.060
Misaki, it's time for a swift attack!

04:53.060 --> 04:56.050
<i>Even though Misaki is down due to his leg injury,</i>

04:56.050 --> 04:58.310
<i>Tsubasa still sends a pass to him!</i>

04:58.310 --> 05:01.320
<i>I only have Misaki!</i>

05:01.320 --> 05:03.140
<i>You can do it, Misaki!</i>

05:03.140 --> 05:06.610
<i>We'll show them our final Golden Duo play!</i>

05:07.380 --> 05:08.490
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

05:09.910 --> 05:10.700
<i>Dad!</i>

05:11.290 --> 05:12.370
<i>Mom!</i>

05:12.370 --> 05:14.500
<i>This is my final play!</i>

05:14.500 --> 05:18.210
<i>Misaki grits his teeth through the pain and charges forward!</i>

05:22.170 --> 05:23.130
What?!

05:24.590 --> 05:26.720
Misaki!

05:26.720 --> 05:28.300
<i>Tsubasa heads forward!</i>

05:32.640 --> 05:34.940
<i>And here it is!</i>

05:34.940 --> 05:38.140
<i>This is Nankatsu's Golden Duo in action!</i>

05:38.140 --> 05:42.060
<i>Their passes are in perfect sync,
dodging defenders one by one!</i>

05:42.060 --> 05:44.570
Misaki, keep going!

05:44.570 --> 05:47.430
Eat this, Wakashimazu!

05:50.110 --> 05:52.910
<i>This effort doesn't end in a goal, either!</i>

05:52.910 --> 05:54.490
Nice, Wakashimazu!

05:55.240 --> 05:56.200
I've got it!

05:56.200 --> 05:57.940
<i>Ishizaki recovers the ball!</i>

05:57.940 --> 05:58.790
Ishizaki!

05:58.790 --> 06:00.420
Tsubasa! Misaki!

06:00.420 --> 06:02.340
Let me in on this, too!

06:02.340 --> 06:03.170
Take this!

06:03.170 --> 06:05.340
<i>Ishizaki sends a high cross!</i>

06:05.340 --> 06:07.840
<i>However, Hyuga is there to cover!</i>

06:07.840 --> 06:09.010
Here I go!

06:09.010 --> 06:11.970
<i>Misaki is setting up for an overhead kick!</i>

06:11.970 --> 06:13.010
Misaki!

06:17.640 --> 06:22.020
<i>Their timing is completely off!</i>

06:22.020 --> 06:22.900
What?!

06:22.900 --> 06:23.770
Tsubasa!

06:28.360 --> 06:32.260
<i>Misaki was a decoy, setting up Tsubasa for a clear overhead kick!</i>

06:32.260 --> 06:35.990
<i>It's Nankatsu's Golden Duo's delayed overhead kick!</i>

06:35.990 --> 06:38.870
Go!

06:40.980 --> 06:44.130
<i>It's in! Goal!</i>

06:49.130 --> 06:51.000
-You did it!
-That was great, Tsubasa!

06:51.000 --> 06:52.430
Awesome goal!

06:52.430 --> 06:54.180
-All right!
-We did it!

06:52.430 --> 06:56.020
<i>What excellent cooperation between Nankatsu's Golden Duo!</i>

06:56.020 --> 06:59.670
<i>Right as 1:30 had passed in this decisive and final extra time,</i>

06:59.670 --> 07:02.560
<i>Nankatsu finally takes the lead!</i>

07:02.560 --> 07:04.660
Tsubasa! Misaki!

07:04.660 --> 07:07.320
Wakabayashi's plan worked out!

07:07.320 --> 07:09.610
-Tsubasa!
-Tsubasa...

07:09.610 --> 07:12.540
<i>Hyuga was tricked by Misaki's jump.</i>

07:12.540 --> 07:15.740
<i>He wasn't able to stop Tsubasa's overhead kick!</i>

07:15.740 --> 07:21.390
<i>Even Wakashimazu was caught flat-footed and was unable to react to this shot!</i>

07:21.390 --> 07:22.370
Damn it!

07:23.140 --> 07:26.880
<i>The cooperation between Nankatsu's Golden Duo was marvelous!</i>

07:26.880 --> 07:28.130
Misaki!

07:28.130 --> 07:29.090
Tsubasa!

07:29.630 --> 07:31.420
<i>Well done, Taro.</i>

07:31.420 --> 07:32.930
Taro!

07:32.930 --> 07:36.070
<i>But there are still more than 3 minutes left.</i>

07:36.070 --> 07:39.840
<i>No one expects Hyuga, the ferocious tiger, to simply give up!</i>

07:39.840 --> 07:41.490
<i>Don't you lose, Kojiro!</i>

07:41.490 --> 07:43.230
<i>Don't throw your hopes away!</i>

07:43.230 --> 07:44.840
Big bro...

07:44.840 --> 07:46.310
Kojiro...

07:46.310 --> 07:49.220
<i>As expected of you, Tsubasa and Misaki.</i>

07:49.220 --> 07:54.290
<i>Your combinations don't even need discussing, as if you understood each other through telepathy.</i>

07:54.290 --> 07:57.280
<i>But I have not lost yet.</i>

07:58.780 --> 08:01.750
<i>Meiwa FC goes on the attack right after the kick-off!</i>

08:01.750 --> 08:04.460
<i>They have enough spirit to tie this game.</i>

08:04.460 --> 08:07.170
Guys! Don't let up just because we're in the lead!

08:07.170 --> 08:09.060
Stay focused!

08:09.060 --> 08:09.880
Yes!

08:11.550 --> 08:14.380
Just hold on a little longer, I'm begging you!

08:14.860 --> 08:16.180
Stay with us, Misaki.

08:16.180 --> 08:17.570
We're almost there!

08:17.570 --> 08:18.730
Right.

08:18.730 --> 08:20.710
<i>Tsubasa... Misaki...</i>

08:20.710 --> 08:25.140
<i>You have taught me that I can't play football alone.</i>

08:25.900 --> 08:26.990
Hyuga!

08:26.990 --> 08:30.940
<i>Also, that football isn't just a contest of strength.</i>

08:30.940 --> 08:35.330
<i>But above all, what I really felt after playing against you,</i>

08:35.330 --> 08:36.950
<i>was the true joy of playing.</i>

08:36.950 --> 08:40.920
<i>Football really was this fun, after all.</i>

08:41.950 --> 08:45.050
<i>Hyuga quickly advances in front of Nankatsu's goal.</i>

08:45.050 --> 08:47.540
<i>Meiwa's attack is really well-balanced.</i>

08:47.540 --> 08:48.400
Stop him!

08:48.400 --> 08:49.920
Don't let him get any further!

08:50.390 --> 08:55.420
<i>Until now, all I had done was fight for my family, or for glory.</i>

08:56.300 --> 09:02.470
<i>But now, with you as my rivals,
I have come to see the true joy in playing football.</i>

09:04.550 --> 09:07.060
<i>Hyuga breaks through with force!</i>

09:07.060 --> 09:08.730
<i>But, even as I say that...</i>

09:08.730 --> 09:12.070
<i>I haven't given up on winning!</i>

09:12.070 --> 09:14.440
<i>This football I play only aims to win.</i>

09:14.440 --> 09:16.320
<i>There's no defeat in my football!</i>

09:16.320 --> 09:18.360
<i>A tackle from Ishizaki!</i>

09:18.360 --> 09:22.120
<i>But Hyuga dodges with a well-timed jump!</i>

09:22.120 --> 09:25.870
<i>Even if it's fun, there's no point if you lose!</i>

09:25.870 --> 09:29.250
<i>Hyuga gets ready to shoot right away!</i>

09:29.250 --> 09:31.630
I won't let you score now!

09:31.630 --> 09:32.500
Tsubasa!

09:32.500 --> 09:35.180
<i>Tsubasa jumps to block him!</i>

09:35.180 --> 09:37.420
Take this, Takeshi!

09:37.420 --> 09:42.100
<i>Hyuga makes a split-second decision, changing his shot to a pass, instead!</i>

09:42.100 --> 09:44.650
<i>Sawada, unmarked, rushes in!</i>

09:44.650 --> 09:46.850
<i>It's a chance to score for Meiwa!</i>

09:47.560 --> 09:49.850
<i>Sawada shoots!</i>

09:50.650 --> 09:53.650
<i>Wakabayashi stops them once again!</i>

09:54.900 --> 09:56.030
You did it!

09:56.030 --> 09:57.990
Nice catch, Wakabayashi!

09:57.990 --> 10:00.320
{incomprehensible cheers}

10:00.320 --> 10:05.330
<i>That was an excellent chance for Meiwa,
but thanks to Wakabayashi's splendid save,</i>

10:05.330 --> 10:06.870
<i>they were still unable to score!</i>

10:07.790 --> 10:09.610
I'm sorry, Hyuga.

10:09.610 --> 10:11.380
Don't dwell on it, Takeshi.

10:11.380 --> 10:13.710
There's still two minutes to go.

10:13.710 --> 10:17.720
If I can shoot at least once every minute, we can win.

10:17.720 --> 10:22.570
Just like Tsubasa and Misaki, Wakabayashi's leg is injured.

10:22.570 --> 10:26.850
In that last save, you can clearly see
that his condition is getting much worse.

10:26.850 --> 10:30.740
If I can just freely shoot, I can break Wakabayashi's goal down.

10:30.740 --> 10:33.160
We can win this match!

10:41.070 --> 10:44.370
<i>Nankatsu is still in the lead with a score of 3-2.</i>

10:44.370 --> 10:46.510
<i>Only 2 minutes remain.</i>

10:46.510 --> 10:50.160
<i>This final match is about to reach its conclusion!</i>

10:50.160 --> 10:52.400
That goal was my responsibility.

10:52.400 --> 10:55.040
I'll fully use my karate to make up for it!

10:55.040 --> 10:59.800
<i>If Nankatsu can just keep the ball for the remaining time, they will win! What will they do?</i>

11:00.310 --> 11:02.220
Let's go, Wakabayashi.

11:02.220 --> 11:04.260
I will keep pushing!

11:04.260 --> 11:06.100
All right, get that!

11:08.820 --> 11:12.640
<i>Wakabayashi falls to the ground as he tries to throw the ball!</i>

11:13.560 --> 11:14.900
Wakabayashi!

11:14.900 --> 11:21.900
<i>Wakabayashi seemed to be bearing with the injury to his left leg, but this is the most painful expression we've seen from him until now!</i>

11:21.900 --> 11:22.980
Now's my chance!

11:22.980 --> 11:26.910
<i>Meiwa's Sawada is rushing to the goal
to capitalize on this opening!</i>

11:26.910 --> 11:28.160
I won't let you!

11:29.660 --> 11:31.350
<i>Takasugi clears the ball!</i>

11:31.350 --> 11:33.040
<i>Nankatsu has survived the danger!</i>

11:33.040 --> 11:36.540
<i>But Wakabayashi has yet to get up!</i>

11:36.540 --> 11:39.510
<i>Damn it... is this the end for me?</i>

11:39.510 --> 11:41.020
Genzo!

11:41.020 --> 11:43.260
Morisaki, start warming up.

11:43.260 --> 11:44.090
Yes, sir!

11:44.090 --> 11:46.000
<i>Okay, I got this!</i>

11:46.000 --> 11:47.600
<i>Wakabayashi is done for.</i>

11:47.600 --> 11:50.100
<i>As long as I shoot, it will be a goal.</i>

11:50.100 --> 11:52.520
<i>Meiwa recovers the cleared ball.</i>

11:52.520 --> 11:54.900
Lets go! It's our chance!

11:54.900 --> 11:59.530
<i>Meiwa FC goes for a quick break!</i>

11:59.530 --> 12:02.880
Guys, we must stop them from shooting, no matter what!

12:02.880 --> 12:04.640
We'll steal the ball back!

12:04.640 --> 12:05.360
Yeah!

12:05.360 --> 12:11.370
<i>As Nankatsu's captain, Tsubasa gives the order
to get into a defensive lineup.</i>

12:12.200 --> 12:15.190
<i>As they've realized Wakabayashi is unable to continue,</i>

12:15.190 --> 12:18.130
<i>the substitute keeper, Morisaki, waits on the sidelines.</i>

12:18.130 --> 12:21.740
<i>But substitutions can only be made when the ball is out of bounds,</i>

12:21.740 --> 12:25.470
<i>or the game stops due to a called foul.</i>

12:25.470 --> 12:28.530
<i>As I thought, Nankatsu will substitute Wakabayashi out.</i>

12:28.530 --> 12:31.390
<i>I must score no matter what before that happens!</i>

12:31.390 --> 12:33.890
<i>Hyuga dashes towards the goal.</i>

12:34.320 --> 12:36.900
<i>Misaki sticks closely to him!</i>

12:36.900 --> 12:40.780
<i>I may not be able to make any more combination plays with Tsubasa,</i>

12:40.780 --> 12:42.060
<i>but I can still defend!</i>

12:42.060 --> 12:45.110
<i>I will play for Nankatsu as long as my strength lets me.</i>

12:45.800 --> 12:48.070
<i>I will mark Kojiro.</i>

12:48.070 --> 12:51.540
<i>Misaki is marking Hyuga, their ace, thoroughly!</i>

12:51.540 --> 12:54.130
<i>Meiwa can't find a way to pass the ball to him!</i>

12:54.130 --> 12:55.330
Hey!

12:55.330 --> 12:56.960
Let's steal the ball!

12:59.380 --> 13:02.400
<i>Damn it, Nankatsu is still as tenacious as ever.</i>

13:02.400 --> 13:05.300
<i>It's no good! I have to do something!</i>

13:05.300 --> 13:08.280
<i>Less than a minute remains in the match.</i>

13:07.450 --> 13:08.280
Stop them!

13:08.280 --> 13:11.930
<i>Will Nankatsu be able to keep this score without letting them shoot?!</i>

13:11.930 --> 13:13.180
<i>Damn it!</i>

13:14.600 --> 13:17.880
<i>A surprise from Meiwa here!</i>

13:17.880 --> 13:20.520
<i>Wakashimazu, the goalkeeper, has joined the attack!</i>

13:20.520 --> 13:23.150
I will score the tying goal!

13:23.150 --> 13:26.990
<i>Meiwa puts together a last ditch attack with their entire team!</i>

13:26.990 --> 13:28.200
Wakashimazu!

13:28.200 --> 13:29.320
Takeshi!

13:28.200 --> 13:29.320
He's cute, so let's forgive him

13:29.320 --> 13:33.490
<i>Hyuga breaks free, taking advantage of Misaki's distractedness!</i>

13:33.490 --> 13:34.370
Hyuga!

13:35.800 --> 13:37.610
<i>Hyuga gets the ball!</i>

13:37.610 --> 13:38.870
<i>Okay, got it!</i>

13:38.870 --> 13:39.880
Wha–

13:39.880 --> 13:41.190
I won't let you!

13:41.190 --> 13:44.380
<i>Tsubasa challenges with every ounce of his remaining strength!</i>

13:45.630 --> 13:48.880
<i>Will Tsubasa's sliding tackle reach him in time?</i>

13:48.880 --> 13:51.390
<i>Or will Hyuga shoot first?</i>

13:51.390 --> 13:54.140
<i>It's their final battle!</i>

13:56.290 --> 13:58.520
<i>His shot was faster!</i>

13:58.520 --> 14:01.310
<i>It's a jumping volley from Hyuga!</i>

14:01.310 --> 14:03.410
<i>Will it be the tying goal?!</i>

14:03.410 --> 14:04.290
<i>Damn it all...</i>

14:04.290 --> 14:05.490
<i>Like I'd give up!</i>

14:05.490 --> 14:07.490
<i>It's only my left leg that's hurt...</i>

14:07.490 --> 14:10.070
<i>I still have this good one!</i>

14:10.070 --> 14:13.330
<i>He jumped with his right leg alone.</i>

14:13.330 --> 14:14.450
What?!

14:15.640 --> 14:17.700
<i>He can't reach it...!</i>

14:21.500 --> 14:23.500
<i>It's stopped!</i>

14:24.590 --> 14:25.960
Wakabayashi!

14:26.780 --> 14:29.380
<i>After jumping with his right leg, he used his hand,</i>

14:29.380 --> 14:33.100
<i>extending his jump just enough to deflect the shot!</i>

14:33.100 --> 14:35.260
<i>Meiwa was still unable to score!</i>

14:35.260 --> 14:36.720
Okay, I'll clear the ball!

14:36.720 --> 14:39.230
I won't let you!

14:44.900 --> 14:49.060
<i>That's a karate move, a flying side kick!</i>

14:49.060 --> 14:50.960
<i>If this on course, it will tie the game!</i>

14:50.960 --> 14:51.680
Yes!

14:51.680 --> 14:53.240
I can't...

14:54.140 --> 14:55.860
<i>I won't let this in.</i>

14:55.860 --> 14:58.280
<i>I won't let this shot get in!</i>

14:58.280 --> 15:00.660
<i>I must stop this shot at any cost!</i>

15:00.660 --> 15:02.660
<i>We will win!</i>

15:03.400 --> 15:04.760
<i>He barely stopped it!</i>

15:04.760 --> 15:06.840
<i>Just before reaching the goal line!</i>

15:06.840 --> 15:07.580
<i>What?!</i>

15:07.580 --> 15:09.690
<i>A brilliant, fine play from Misaki!</i>

15:09.690 --> 15:12.340
<i>Meiwa couldn't score again!</i>

15:14.100 --> 15:18.470
<i>Misaki's momentum sends him careening into the goalpost.</i>

15:18.470 --> 15:19.680
Misaki!

15:20.720 --> 15:23.340
<i>He was only able to stop that by going full speed!</i>

15:23.340 --> 15:27.310
<i>That said, he was probably aware of the risk he was taking by doing so!</i>

15:27.310 --> 15:31.640
<i>Misaki's put himself on the line for the sake of that play!</i>

15:33.260 --> 15:34.570
Misaki...

15:35.450 --> 15:37.030
Tsubasa.

15:37.640 --> 15:39.290
Tsubasa.

15:39.290 --> 15:40.560
Tsubasa...

15:40.560 --> 15:43.290
Tsubasa.

15:44.100 --> 15:45.540
TSUBASA!

15:45.540 --> 15:47.920
The ball is still alive!

15:47.920 --> 15:50.220
<i>There are just 30 seconds left in this match.</i>

15:50.220 --> 15:53.630
<i>Meiwa's betting on this last chance to go for the ball!</i>

15:59.850 --> 16:00.850
Tsubasa!

16:00.850 --> 16:03.340
<i>Tsubasa turns and attacks!</i>

16:03.340 --> 16:07.150
<i>He keeps the ball and charges defiantly towards Meiwa's goal!</i>

16:07.150 --> 16:08.150
Tsubasa!

16:08.150 --> 16:09.190
Return!

16:13.450 --> 16:16.950
<i>Meiwa can't steal the ball at all.</i>

16:16.950 --> 16:21.160
<i>Where in that tiny body was he hiding all of this stamina?!</i>

16:21.160 --> 16:25.000
<i>And let's not forget that his left leg is still injured!</i>

16:25.000 --> 16:30.630
<i>This heaven-sent prodigy of football,
Tsubasa Ozora is putting on a one-man show!</i>

16:25.000 --> 16:30.630
Tsubasa!

16:30.630 --> 16:34.640
<i>The first match against Meiwa ended with us losing, 7-6.</i>

16:34.640 --> 16:38.040
<i>Now, we're leading 3-2 in this final match.</i>

16:38.040 --> 16:41.470
<i>That means our battle is still a tie!</i>

16:41.470 --> 16:45.060
<i>To truly seize victory, we must score once more.</i>

16:45.060 --> 16:48.580
<i>I will score once more and secure our win, once and for all!</i>

16:48.580 --> 16:49.820
<i>And then...</i>

16:49.820 --> 16:52.900
<i>Then, I will go to Brazil!</i>

16:52.900 --> 16:54.320
Stop him, Takeshi!

16:54.320 --> 16:55.070
Okay!

16:59.280 --> 17:01.580
<i>No one will take this ball from me!</i>

17:01.580 --> 17:04.370
<i>I won't give it up until I score once more!</i>

17:04.370 --> 17:06.480
<i>What's wrong with Sawada, I wonder?</i>

17:06.480 --> 17:09.460
<i>Tsubasa blows past him without much resistance!</i>

17:09.460 --> 17:11.420
<i>Such blazing eyes.</i>

17:14.590 --> 17:17.340
<i>There are only a few seconds left!</i>

17:17.340 --> 17:19.940
<i>Tsubasa, this is our final battle!</i>

17:19.940 --> 17:24.930
<i>I will steal the ball from you and bet everything on a long shot from here.</i>

17:24.930 --> 17:27.040
<i>Come, Kojiro Hyuga!</i>

17:27.040 --> 17:28.230
<i>I won't lose!</i>

17:29.640 --> 17:31.980
<i>They clash fiercely!</i>

17:31.980 --> 17:34.780
<i>Truly, this is their last confrontation!</i>

17:39.700 --> 17:41.070
<i>He breaks through!</i>

17:41.070 --> 17:45.540
<i>In the final clash, Tsubasa foregoes technique and breaks through with sheer force!</i>

17:47.500 --> 17:48.540
I lost...

17:48.540 --> 17:51.790
<i>It's all up to Wakashimazu now!</i>

17:51.790 --> 17:53.710
<i>One more goal...</i>

17:53.710 --> 17:54.550
<i>Damn it!</i>

17:55.890 --> 17:58.720
<i>Tsubasa gets ready to shoot!</i>

18:00.470 --> 18:02.720
<i>Wakashimazu dives for the ball.</i>

18:04.160 --> 18:08.730
<i>Tsubasa pauses, dodging Wakashimazu's charge instead of shooting!</i>

18:09.600 --> 18:10.850
<i>What?!</i>

18:18.320 --> 18:19.650
<i>He's through!</i>

18:21.280 --> 18:25.620
<i>Only Meiwa's goal remains in front of Tsubasa!</i>

18:25.620 --> 18:28.120
It's Nankatsu's victory with this!

18:29.620 --> 18:32.750
BallSAT 1 launches away

18:35.820 --> 18:41.220
<i>The ball rips through the net and flies up into the sky!</i>

18:44.350 --> 18:48.690
<i>The whistle blows, and the match is over!</i>

18:48.690 --> 18:50.320
We did it, Tsubasa!

18:50.320 --> 18:52.940
We won! We won it!

18:52.940 --> 18:54.610
We are the champions!

18:54.610 --> 18:55.500
You did it!

18:55.500 --> 18:56.700
Tsubasa!

18:56.700 --> 19:02.790
<i>This fierce 7-day long competition
has come to an end with Nankatsu SC's victory.</i>

19:02.790 --> 19:04.990
Congratulations, Tsubasa.

19:05.460 --> 19:07.450
You finally did it, huh?

19:07.450 --> 19:09.300
Misaki, it's over.

19:09.300 --> 19:10.380
We did it!

19:10.380 --> 19:11.920
We've won!

19:11.920 --> 19:12.830
Yeah!

19:15.090 --> 19:16.260
Wakabayashi!

19:16.260 --> 19:17.130
Hey.

19:17.130 --> 19:18.550
Misaki, we won!

19:18.550 --> 19:20.380
Wakabayashi, we did it!

19:20.380 --> 19:23.970
<i>Nankatsu SC put on a good show!</i>

19:23.970 --> 19:26.600
<i>Their faces are alight after this dramatic victory!</i>

19:27.270 --> 19:31.060
<i>Despite losing, Meiwa FC really worked hard!</i>

19:32.980 --> 19:35.020
We lost...

19:35.020 --> 19:39.320
<i>They might not be the champions, but they remain the runner-ups.</i>

19:39.320 --> 19:42.900
<i>Meiwa FC have really put on a good show, as well!</i>

19:42.900 --> 19:45.020
You did great, Meiwa!

19:45.020 --> 19:46.910
Second place is still great!

19:46.910 --> 19:49.280
Good job, Kojiro.

19:49.280 --> 19:50.580
Big bro...

19:50.580 --> 19:52.890
So, it's Nankatsu's victory.

19:52.890 --> 19:55.830
I guess we'll be scouting Tsubasa after all.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.670
Yeah...

20:00.680 --> 20:02.590
Hyuga.

20:03.420 --> 20:04.500
Tsubasa.

20:04.500 --> 20:05.320
Oh...

20:08.780 --> 20:09.920
As expected of you.

20:09.920 --> 20:11.240
I've lost, Tsubasa.

20:11.240 --> 20:12.850
Huh?

20:12.850 --> 20:14.310
Hyuga...

20:14.310 --> 20:18.450
I didn't expect you'd use your strength to get past me in the end.

20:18.450 --> 20:20.100
You blew me away.

20:20.100 --> 20:23.100
You deserved to win this match.

20:23.100 --> 20:24.240
Hyuga.

20:25.340 --> 20:26.990
Hyuga!

20:28.780 --> 20:34.600
Misaki, even I couldn't do a thing against your Golden Duo with Tsubasa.

20:34.600 --> 20:35.900
Kojiro...

20:35.900 --> 20:37.580
Get better soon.

20:37.580 --> 20:43.560
Wakabayashi, in the end, I couldn't score on you from outside the penalty area.

20:43.560 --> 20:48.650
But next time we meet, I'll definitely score against you. Keep that in mind.

20:48.650 --> 20:50.850
Sure thing! I'm looking forward to it.

20:50.850 --> 20:53.720
You had me at a loss.

20:53.720 --> 20:56.350
It's the first time I've given up 4 goals in a match.

20:58.700 --> 21:01.540
<i>Following Tsubasa and Hyuga's lead,</i>

21:01.540 --> 21:06.460
<i>both Nankatsu and Meiwa are exchanging words and handshakes.</i>

21:06.460 --> 21:10.550
<i>They're freely expressing their feelings cheerfully</i>

21:10.550 --> 21:14.700
<i>after fighting over the last 60 minutes until the very end of the match.</i>

21:15.340 --> 21:20.700
<i>The curtain closes on the National Youth Football Tournament with Nankatsu's victory.</i>

21:20.700 --> 21:26.850
<i>However, more than anything, we wish that each team is able to treasure</i>

21:26.850 --> 21:30.850
<i>the bonds of friendship that they have forged during this tournament.</i>

21:30.850 --> 21:33.100
<i>You did it, Tsubasa!</i>

21:33.100 --> 21:35.770
<i>Congratulations, Misaki.</i>

21:35.770 --> 21:38.900
Congratulations, Tsubasa.

21:38.900 --> 21:42.190
<i>Tsubasa, congratulations.</i>

21:42.190 --> 21:46.630
<i>I have nothing else to say to you right now.</i>

21:46.630 --> 21:50.240
<i>You have grown even more during this tournament.</i>

21:50.840 --> 21:55.190
<i>You've met many different opponents
and learned different things from them,</i>

21:55.190 --> 21:57.790
<i>and you've made it to the end as a result.</i>

21:57.790 --> 22:03.920
<i>And, just as you promised, you have
successfully become National Champions.</i>

22:05.170 --> 22:09.680
<i>But unfortunately, Tsubasa, I just can't keep my promise.</i>

22:10.150 --> 22:12.680
<i>If I win, we'll go to Brazil together, Roberto!</i>

22:14.620 --> 22:18.980
<i>This is goodbye, Tsubasa...</i>

22:38.830 --> 22:44.710
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.830 --> 22:44.710
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.710 --> 22:50.720
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.710 --> 22:50.720
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.720 --> 22:56.720
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.720 --> 22:56.720
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.720 --> 23:02.190
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.720 --> 23:02.190
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.150 --> 23:08.320
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.150 --> 23:08.320
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.240 --> 23:15.030
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.240 --> 23:15.030
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.030 --> 23:21.080
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.080 --> 23:26.090
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.080 --> 23:26.090
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.380 --> 23:33.260
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.380 --> 23:33.260
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.260 --> 23:39.140
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.140 --> 23:46.020
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.140 --> 23:46.020
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.110 --> 24:00.630
COMING UP, EPISODE 28:
TO EACH, HIS OWN DEPARTURE
